msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Time pressed "
"onward,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Il tempo passò,"

#: scenario6:scenario6_E00C943F_4D75_42F5_B79C_13668E56E37E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c16267877df05f837125bf2492ec25585a048a64e44374769cacf86fb4bb4177
#. default-sha256: 71d3c1066b1a3cab8b31a8cb9144593fe065e0ccff497a2487fe8f8fb891ef89
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_E00C943F_4D75_42F5_B79C_13668E56E37E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and then, at long last, you arrived."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫e poi, finalmente, arrivasti tu."

#: scenario6:scenario6_DD418C23_5115_4DCC_BC33_8D2938BF2673
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: feb65edfd2f339edbbacac71c20ead2b00bb297b727621eeafc6b332249e14e3
#. default-sha256: 99880b5c6fc2778a8842b78a9649c89f9b757ce5d626d57d9a10852c8c532dd0
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_DD418C23_5115_4DCC_BC33_8D2938BF2673"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Oh, splendid...⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫You have finally awoken."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Ah, finalmente...⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Non vedevo l’ora che si "
"svegliasse."

#: scenario6:scenario6_D6CCF4FC_DAA4_44F3_A35A_928A6859D487
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: beb8d21eb7302a8f4d5417d8d2bdfb7fdd88bf7eaabc0c034003afa52e234695
#. default-sha256: 7d51a23dbd5b1234a4b2748e8459294557fab0db2c14d587a18f763c953938fe
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_D6CCF4FC_DAA4_44F3_A35A_928A6859D487"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I have simply been waiting so long for this moment."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ho semplicemente atteso questo momento da così tanto tempo."

#: scenario6:scenario6_EFCBAFD9_6E52_4944_8753_711F7D9B6242
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 171539c415d9186a63f126be8b3f34f0c56beef3a2b4d4676a79edb546e2052e
#. default-sha256: 7e601de1c11f619dc42df35315f4d96d85e845a0e76c5fc9d723e982e77c26fb
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_EFCBAFD9_6E52_4944_8753_711F7D9B6242"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tending to the mansion all by my lonesome,⟪k:1⟫ensuring it was ready for your return, Master—"
"⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫whenever that time may be."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Prendendomi cura della villa tutta da sola,⟪k:1⟫assicurandomi che fosse pronta per il suo "
"ritorno—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫qualunque sarebbe stato il momento."

#: scenario6:scenario6_0C8D0830_48A8_4A58_A8AC_3AE5EA6582BC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fba6cc474d5e82f966172aca23c910ca8466519d277621e27e0cbcaada6965c6
#. default-sha256: b5f169a58fe05a9676a90d4ad3c7e25e8b10ecc28184be6aa62a8f5c90ecf5b3
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_0C8D0830_48A8_4A58_A8AC_3AE5EA6582BC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫When I caught sight of you through the window,⟪k:1⟫my heart fluttered. ⟪k:2⟫The time had "
"finally arrived."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Appena l’ho vista attraverso la finestra,⟪k:1⟫il cuore ha iniziato a battermi.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Il "
"momento era finalmente arrivato."

#: scenario6:scenario6_67B74B9F_702E_4DDA_9756_FBF35BA48BFA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b666490a59e804bedcc2d38e81661a0b69a56211ff7bff16ac2b1903bf8dd109
#. default-sha256: 34d870f2fc25c5b6ec6bcbfed388b02846ac1cde33361907179b1aabdd493831
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_67B74B9F_702E_4DDA_9756_FBF35BA48BFA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh my, you do not know who I am?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Do you not know who you are, either?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh, lei non sa chi sono?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Non sa nemmeno chi è lei?"

#: scenario6:scenario6_2D316048_7959_4D35_9CC6_A42713AAF5F1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2629db7eecbb6c43aa1af4c3b5ab399391cca43143562d4d1e9f214b66feb929
#. default-sha256: e27c3077952fba4e5e0139bc64fc17abde32d744d1a349c9fe391d5c15d31484
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_2D316048_7959_4D35_9CC6_A42713AAF5F1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That is quite the predicament."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Questo sì che è un bel guaio."

#: scenario6:scenario6_39AFFC0F_BAC7_44C7_9951_ACB95A3C6BFA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d9df16beb4471fbf4e4b2dab7719db3764ff286a6bd013a8f878f8a041672bdb
#. default-sha256: 4700c6f76eb6b200582944eb2b2e7dc6c41f8e81ecfe7e98ffedb4996679d5ce
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_39AFFC0F_BAC7_44C7_9951_ACB95A3C6BFA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Then how about this?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Che ne dice allora...?"

#: scenario6:scenario6_F56C1453_143C_4056_A206_C584B42B7282
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f5aec9d4b236b249404ce47ef32294eff3c825d37dc0eaa4ba333a30b5491f29
#. default-sha256: 2cd51a620fa6be477062215e18a3b7e68f2ffd7890a531e4a4d0ba3502972cae
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_F56C1453_143C_4056_A206_C584B42B7282"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I am a servant of this mansion, and as such, I am familiar with the many incidents that have "
"taken place here.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I shall show you the history of this house, Master."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sono una servitrice di questa villa, e in quanto tale, conosco molto bene i numerosi "
"incidenti che hanno avuto luogo tra queste mura.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Le mostrerò la storia di questa casa, "
"Padrone."

#: scenario6:scenario6_82B04417_9973_4CFA_B57C_199EC1D32C00
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1f77eddf4bdabc394c2c6f18dd6e0816dc12111c4631c2544a49879ce21ff29f
#. default-sha256: 3520ebb73ec27acd25919adf780a9d6ca8431c7ffe6b10b1130ec250507f37d2
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_82B04417_9973_4CFA_B57C_199EC1D32C00"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Let us be off, then.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫And fear not—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I merely entreat you not to let go "
"of my hand."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Andiamo, allora.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫E non abbia paura—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫le chiedo solamente di non "
"lasciare la mia mano."

#: scenario6:scenario6_4863F686_6A3A_40FA_8698_038389769158
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9244d9388635c7be1328781400d4d44dfbb898ad6ea16dea9e48d49e1172353d
#. default-sha256: 78f3c664c621de3c27b23a63471e62bdef0d23778d4c5dea676736a0975ecd35
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_4863F686_6A3A_40FA_8698_038389769158"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Should you hold it tightly, you need not worry about being washed away by the waves of "
"history."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Fintanto che la tiene stretta, non deve temere che le correnti della storia possano "
"spazzarla via."

#: scenario6:scenario6_24F59810_6B2E_4DD4_AB93_1073D746BA04
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cb8c3241608c28afb8147afa124768388518e6b55e1ce8fdd0f54879c50e27ef
#. default-sha256: c33547637b6cc59e2d4e4e7cda6b7bbbe07c8cf8ead3ad228ae8d3d0a453f9c7
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_24F59810_6B2E_4DD4_AB93_1073D746BA04"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫No matter what happens, you mustn’t let go of my hand."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Non importa cosa accadrà, non deve lasciare la mia mano."

#: scenario6:scenario6_163EC0D0_E2FF_4174_9059_D4A83D451B52
