msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Non importa cosa accadrà..."

#: scenario6:scenario6_4DF94911_E146_44DB_9E37_A31671194188
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 390f610a4c22b67fdb00522c487819e2a17d15dcef2ec94bf105f91b42779da5
#. default-sha256: 209666739bed885f4e762b320379017edc3e4d16f29cba9fa1b83fb76a940d89
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_4DF94911_E146_44DB_9E37_A31671194188"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫no matter what you see..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫non importa cosa vedrai..."

#: scenario6:scenario6_BF129CA0_712B_4687_BB76_D5CAAE6E3137
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b36991385ced6d7c93a231722ed005248d800d8bb2ae395803a212e81d752857
#. default-sha256: e25cb18bd79ec3b52cacab8b1f7112fd2abb478a216517c691ec83e466221261
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_BF129CA0_712B_4687_BB76_D5CAAE6E3137"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫never again..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫non lasciare la mia mano..."

#: scenario6:scenario6_9CB7481D_46BE_4B1A_ACA9_2845B727CBC5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 60bf203b4049834dd0825c9c022ae369da3d0d917087397bbce0f40646424ec9
