msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫When her fingers brush against my skin, they feel as frigid as death itself—⟪k:1⟫far colder "
"than anything I have felt from her thus far."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Appena le sue dita sfiorano la mia pelle, le sento gelide come la morte stessa—⟪k:1⟫molto "
"più fredde di quanto lei sia mai stata finora."

